# carves out paths within that set to leave alone. oxfmt reads this file too,
# so a path listed here is left alone by both formatters.

# Build output and caches.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/

# Third-party Markdown, kept byte-for-byte as received from upstream.
packages/icons/data/

# Eval fixtures: projects an agent works on, kept byte-for-byte because their
